<div class="sect" style="margin-top:4px">DOCKS (<%~ it.docksPayloadCount %> of 4)</div><div class="dim small">Each dock holds a lead ship and up to two wingmates, chosen from your stored ships. You fly the lead of your <b>active</b> dock, and its wingmates fly in formation with you. Officers you assign as a wingmate's captain and crew boost that ship. More docks open as your station's Station Tier rises.</div>